<section xmlns="http://xml.house.gov/schemas/uslm/1.0" style="-uslm-lc:I80" id="id473c0663-86b3-11f1-937c-a78dceb78abb" identifier="/us/usc/t7/s91"><num value="91">§ 91.</num><heading> Short title</heading><content>
<p style="-uslm-lc:I11" class="indent0">For convenience of reference, this chapter may be designated and cited as “The Naval Stores Act.”</p>
</content><sourceCredit id="id473c0664-86b3-11f1-937c-a78dceb78abb">(<ref href="/us/act/1923-03-03/ch217/s1">Mar. 3, 1923, ch. 217, § 1</ref>, <ref href="/us/stat/42/1435">42 Stat. 1435</ref>.)</sourceCredit>
<notes type="uscNote" id="id473c0665-86b3-11f1-937c-a78dceb78abb">
<note style="-uslm-lc:I74" role="crossHeading" topic="statutoryNotes" id="id473c0666-86b3-11f1-937c-a78dceb78abb"><heading class="centered"><b>Statutory Notes and Related Subsidiaries</b></heading></note>
<note style="-uslm-lc:I74" topic="effectiveDate" id="id473c0667-86b3-11f1-937c-a78dceb78abb"><heading class="centered smallCaps">Effective Date</heading><p><ref href="/us/act/1923-03-03/ch217/s10">Act Mar. 3, 1923, ch. 217, § 10</ref>, <ref href="/us/stat/42/1437">42 Stat. 1437</ref>, provided: <quotedContent origin="/us/act/1923-03-03/ch217/s10">“That this Act [enacting this chapter] shall become effective at the expiration of ninety days next after the date of its approval [<date date="1923-03-23">Mar. 23, 1923</date>].”</quotedContent>
</p>
</note>
